        -40.0,
        960.0
      ],
      "size": [
        360.0,
        120.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "text": "200 filters with parts drawn within their tolerance. The histogram shows the spread of f-3dB, the requirement how many of them meet 1.10-1.20 kHz (the yield).",
