        0.0,
        1300.0
      ],
      "size": [
        320.0,
        140.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "text": "C2 swept through four values: one curve each, and a table of f-3dB and the peak. A smaller C2 raises fc and Q (the response peaks); a larger one flattens it.",
